    summary """
        liminalkit-text: 83 tests pass with bidi on, 80 with it off (the three feature-gated tests cover a mixed line, mirrored brackets and marks on a reversed base); workspace with bidi on 549 passed, 0 failed; accessibility set 191 passed; clippy -D warnings, rustdoc -D warnings and fmt all clean.
